


~ BillyIntro
if GlobalVars.billy_beaten
	Billy:  [shake rate=20 level=10] I don't want to talk to you anymore... [/shake]
	Billy: [shake rate=20 level=10] Go away! [/shake]
elif GlobalVars.billy_won_game
	Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5]Helloooo my favorite  [speed=0.2][font_size=40][rainbow] [wait=0.5] [wave amp=60 freq=5]LOSER[/wave][/rainbow][/font_size].
	Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] So you want a rematch? [/wave] 
	- Yes 
		$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/competitive_rock_paper_scissors/Rock Paper scissors.tscn"), {"opponent":2}])
	- No 
		Billy: [speed=0.2][font_size=40][rainbow] [wait=0.5] [wave amp=60 freq=5]LOSER[/wave][/rainbow][/font_size].

else
	Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5]Hi! My name is Billy![/wave] [#voice_sound=uid://bm1e4xlpgjw4p]
	Billy : [wave amp=40 freq=5]Everybody loves good ol'  Billy![/wave][#voice_sound=uid://bm1e4xlpgjw4p]
	Billy : [wave amp=25 freq=5]I've been playing competitive rock papers for a while!![/wave] [#voice_sound=uid://bm1e4xlpgjw4p]
	Billy : [wave amp=25 freq=5]So! [wait=0.5] I'm pretty [speed=0.2][font_size=40][rainbow] [wait=0.5] [wave amp=60 freq=5]STRONG.[/wave][/rainbow][/font_size] [#voice_sound=uid://bm1e4xlpgjw4p]
	Billy: Wanna play a game with me? 
	- Yes 
		Billy : [wave amp=40 freq=5]I hope we both have a lot of fun![/wave] [#voice_sound=uid://bm1e4xlpgjw4p]
		$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/competitive_rock_paper_scissors/Rock Paper scissors.tscn"), {"opponent":2}])
	- No 
		Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] That's okay. Not everyone can be as good as ol'Billy.[/wave]
=> END

