~ BillyTutorial
Billy:  [wave amp=40 freq=5] WHAT????? YOU'VE NEVER PLAYED COMPETITIVE ROCK PAPER SCISSORS BEFORE!!!!![/wave]
Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] I'll teach you!!![/wave]
Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] The rules are super simple!! [/wave]
Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] It's like rock paper scissors except you can only choose one of the option of the cards you'll be given. [/wave]
Billy: [wave amp=40 freq=5] You're given 3 cards per round and you can always see on the left how many cards of each there are left in the deck! [/wave]
Billy : [wave amp=25 freq=5]The game may seem simple but it's all about [wait=0.5] THE [speed=0.2][font_size=40][rainbow] [wait=0.5] [wave amp=60 freq=5]PHSYCHOLOGY[/wave][/rainbow][/font_size]
Billy : [wave amp=25 freq=5]Let's play!!! [/wave]
=> END


