~ WillyTutorial
Willy: So you never played this game before ?
Willy: It shows in your little muppet eyes.
Willy: It's like rock, paper, scissors, except you can only pick one of the options from the cards you're given. Fancy that, eh?
Willy: You get 3 cards each round and on the left you can always see how many of each card are still left in the deck. Use your eyes, yeah?
Willy: Now, the game may look simple, but don't be fooled, you cheeky little muppet... you gotta think mate.
Willy: Right then, enough faffing about. Let's bloody play!!!
=> END


